# Pairs with TypeOK. The bound on re-creations is what keeps incarnations
# inside the checked domain.
MODULE: RecreateOverrunsIncarnations
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the grantee is re-created without the incarnation bound
PERTURBS: Recreate

--- FIND
    /\ incB < MaxInc
--- REPLACE
    /\ TRUE
--- END